            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/config_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 38,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "What if this `.find()` fails?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/config_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 38,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "find will give std::string::npos which is of size_t max value.\nso (max_value - startPos) which doesn't exists, substr will extract till end of the string. \nwhich is the case for \"/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/chassis0\" so it extract till end.\n\nA value of string::npos indicates all characters until the end of the string.\nref link: https://cplusplus.com/reference/string/string/npos/\nhttps://cplusplus.com/reference/string/string/substr/"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/config_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 40,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "`std::string.substr()` can throw exception. This is not handled."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/config_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 40,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "start position is valid, so\nsubstr can only fails here if storage allocation fails, addressed it."
                }
            ],
